      "y": 772,
      "width": 432,
      "height": 101.25,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "Stripe retries webhooks on any non-2xx\nresponse or timeout. Before Purchase existed,\na retry would SILENTLY DOUBLE-CREDIT.\n\nNow: check Purchase.stripeSessionId first —\na retry is a safe no-op, not a double charge.",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Stripe retries webhooks on any non-2xx\nresponse or timeout. Before Purchase existed,\na retry would SILENTLY DOUBLE-CREDIT.\n\nNow: check Purchase.stripeSessionId first —\na retry is a safe no-op, not a double charge.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
